        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilomon ooinosua Yohana Olaibatisani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lari le tomon o miet le nkitoria o laiguanani kitok oji Tiberia Kaisaria, aa Pontio Pilato olbalusui le Yudea, naa Herode olkitok le Galilaya, naa Filipo olalashe lenye olkitok le Iturea o Trikoniti, naa Lisenias olkitok le Abilene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa Annas o Kaiafas ilapolosak kituaak, nebaiki ororei le Nkai Yohana olayioni le Sakaria ti ong'ata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo ina kop pooki oo mbat o lkeju le Yordan elikioo enkibatisa naitoduaaya enkirridunoto nayau e mpalakinoto oo ng'ok, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.40.3+ISA.40.4+ISA.40.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 40.3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " anaa enasira te mbuku e Isaya oloiboni le Nkai ajo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
